			"File": [
				"⣿⠁⠀⠀⠀",
				1036,
				237
			],
			"Message": "build(Cocoon): Regenerate Target artifacts with heuristic namespace wrapper\n\nAfter the previous commit removed the entire Target/ compiled artifact tree to force a clean regeneration, this commit represents the fresh build output. The regeneration includes 200+ compiled JavaScript files across Target/Bootstrap, Target/Codegen, Target/Effect, Target/IPC, Target/Interfaces, Target/PatchProcess, Target/Platform, Target/Services, Target/Telemetry, Target/TypeConverter, Target/Utility, and Target/WebviewPanel directories.\n\nSource changes accompanying the regeneration:\n- Update RouteManifest generation timestamp to 2026-06-10T12:50:43Z\n- Simplify CommandService local registry mutation (direct Map.set vs IIFE)\n- Add WrapNamespaceWithHeuristics proxy wrapper for VS Code API namespaces — unknown property accesses now return heuristic stubs instead of undefined, improving resilience when extensions call unsupported APIs\n\nThis completes the clean regeneration cycle with the new heuristic fallback infrastructure for the extension host.",
			"SHA": "b45de46810b2aa45f31613718b97348f460d272c"
		},
