				"⣿⣿⠇⠀⠀",
				630,
				300
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Cocoon): Introduce RouteManifest routing hierarchy and lean Memento implementation\n\nAdd generated Source/Generated/RouteManifest.ts defining the four-tier RPC routing hierarchy for Mountain ↔ Cocoon communication: MountainMethods (tier 1, 146 Rust handlers scanned from Mountain), StockLiftExports (tier 2, pure VS Code lifts, currently empty), BespokeCocoonMethods (tier 3, hand-rolled Node fallbacks: FindTextInFilesNodeFallback), with tier 4 implicit unavailable methods throwing via DualTrack. Add accompanying RouteManifest.Report.md for generation metadata.\n\nRefactor Source/Services/Extension/Context.ts Memento class: replace Effect-TS Ref/Effect.runSync patterns with plain async IIFE initialization and direct Map mutation for get/keys/update/clear operations. Eliminates Effect overhead for hot-path storage access while preserving Mountain persistence via storage:getItems/storage:remove.\n\nReformat Source/ESBuild.js (tabs→spaces, brace style) and Proto/vine.d.ts (compact interfaces). Remove entire Target/ compiled artifact tree (200+ files) to force clean regeneration on next build. TypeScript build info updated accordingly.\n\nThis is a routine regeneration cycle with new routing manifest infrastructure and leaner extension context storage.",
